\begin{tabular}{c c c c c}
\hline
\(\gamma\) & Max Followers & Stable? & Stability & Convergence Time \\
\hline
3  & \(45/99\) & No  & -- & -- \\
5  & \(99/99\) & Yes & 1.00 & 18000 \\
10 & \(99/99\) & Yes & 1.00 & 6000 \\
20 & \(99/99\) & Yes & 1.00 & 12000 \\
\hline
